# Claude factory: one line per repo the dispatcher picks cards for.
#   <repo folder> <Linear project>
# The folder is a git clone (~ is allowed). The project is the Linear project
# name whose Ready For Factory cards belong to that repo. Every line is
# commented out here on purpose: an uncommented line means this machine starts
# claiming that project's cards, so add only the repos you run.
#
# This machine's Linear label, added with `factory` to every card it picks up
# (kevin-omarchy or keith-omarchy):
# label kevin-omarchy
#
# ~/Projects/catalyst-shift catalyst-shift-site
# ~/Projects/lbl-nextjs lbl-nextjs
# ~/Projects/nourish-enablement nourish-rep-enablement
